 746:source\asw/mp3.c ****  *   - MSB of each channel (8/16/24-bit)
 747:source\asw/mp3.c ****  *   - stereo mixed to mono (6C)
 748:source\asw/mp3.c ****  *   - 44100 Hz: 2 input frames averaged per output sample (6D)
